                "Creating a new MaterialApp",
                "Using direct color assignment"
            ],
            "ans": "Using Theme.copyWith()",
            "ansSuggesstion": "Theme.copyWith() creates a new theme with selected overrides while preserving other properties."
        },
        "type": "break",
        "typeOf": "mcq-break"
